{"id":"2fe01ef74fdbff59","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-top-derived-set.md","title":"ZFC Top Derived Set","display":"df-zfc-top-derived-set — ZFC Top Derived Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top-derived-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top-derived-set"],"display":"df-zfc-top-derived-set — ZFC Top Derived Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top-derived-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top-derived-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top-derived-set — ZFC Top Derived Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90335d0f6a9bc60f\" href=\"?note=90335d0f6a9bc60f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference\">58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,A,X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(D,A,X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopDerivedSet}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopDerivedSet}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top\\text{-}derived\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopDerivedSet}_S(D,A,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land \\forall x\\;(x\\in D\\leftrightarrow x\\in X\\land \\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\rightarrow A\\cap(U\\setminus\\{x\\})\\neq\\varnothing))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top\\text{-}derived\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopDerivedSet}_S(D,A,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land \\forall x\\;(x\\in D\\leftrightarrow x\\in X\\land \\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\rightarrow A\\cap(U\\setminus\\{x\\})\\neq\\varnothing))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> is exactly the set of accumulation points of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>: every open neighbourhood of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> contains a point of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> distinct from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference","status":"resolved","id":"90335d0f6a9bc60f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S$ (topological-space predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"D,A,X,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopDerivedSet}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top\\text{-}derived\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopDerivedSet}_S(D,A,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land \\forall x\\;(x\\in D\\leftrightarrow x\\in X\\land \\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\rightarrow A\\cap(U\\setminus\\{x\\})\\neq\\varnothing))","display":true},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false}],"bytes":1088,"backlinks":[{"id":"f1c7840942f0badb","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTopDerivedSet}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch06/58-df-zfc-top-derived-set.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3519","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-top-derived-set.md|58-df-zfc-top-derived-set]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","74086485fba8d86f","90335d0